==Battleground==
*1 [[Nisetama Army (Enemy)|Nisetama Army]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Gudegude à la mode (Enemy)|Gudegude à la mode]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Gudetama Plate (Enemy)|Gudetama Plate]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gudegude à la mode (Enemy)|Gudegude à la modes]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gudetama Plate (Enemy)|Gudetama Plates]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*2 [[Nisetama Army (Enemy)|Nisetama Armies]] spawn after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>, delay 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Area Attackers such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] will be quite helpful here. Bring a few meatshields as well since the Nisetama Armies can be a bit strong especially on 3-Crown difficulty.

